msgstr "[gwexpy.fitting](../reference/api/fitting)"

#: ../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md:217
#: 1ef6cc2881fa4775b7a7c82555244b6e
msgid "6. Adaptive Whitening"
msgstr "6. 適応ホワイトニング"

#: ../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md:218
#: 4e50598a03fb479e88f2a97c5a950b23
msgid ""
"**Target**: `TimeSeriesMatrix.whiten_channels(eps=\"auto\")`, "
"`whiten_matrix()`, `gwexpy.signal.preprocessing.whiten()`, `WhiteningModel`"
msgstr ""
"**対象**: "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.whiten_channels(eps=\"auto\")`、`whiten_matrix()`、`gwexpy.signal.preprocessing.whiten()`、`WhiteningModel`"

#: ../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md:220
#: 9bceeec35a194bc492227636838a5204
msgid ""
"Adaptive whitening uses an automatically chosen stabilization parameter so "
"that PSD-based normalization remains well behaved in the presence of very "
"small bins or local numerical underflow."
msgstr ""
"適応ホワイトニングでは、自動的に決まる安定化パラメータを用いて、非常に小さい PSD "
"ビンや局所的な数値アンダーフローがあっても正規化が破綻しにくいようにしています。"

#: ../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md:223
#: 779f719f355941cc9a431b581cb0d0c9
msgid ""
"The data are treated as locally quasi-stationary over the FFT segments used "
"for whitening."
msgstr "ホワイトニングに用いる FFT セグメントの範囲では、データが局所的に準定常とみなせること。"

#: ../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md:224
#: 065568d8fdec4126be7ae54de51bffe6
msgid ""
"The adaptive `eps` path is intended to stabilize small denominators, not to "
"compensate for a badly chosen whitening window or clearly non-stationary "
"bursts."
msgstr "適応 `eps` は小さい分母を安定化するためのものであり、明らかに非定常なバーストや不適切な窓長設定まで補償するものではありません。"

